{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_2026110102320917b28482452d4a72","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.3","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Simple arithmetic — I'll calculate it directly.\n\n**Surplus:** $4,800 − ($1,650 + $420 + $250 + $180 + $350) = $4,800 − $2,850 = **$1,950/month**\n\n**Time to save $6,000:** $6,000 ÷ $1,950 ≈ 3.08 months — so 3 full months gets you $5,850 (just short), and you'd cross $6,000 during the 4th month."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b524dc73-4c83-4075-bbf9-90f31f62e1ab","uuid":"24daab98-b594-43a4-a7ff-26e38bea0a55","timestamp":"2026-10-31T18:32:14.379Z"}
